fix(codegen): Make `process.run` compile end-to-end and add `tracing` dependency
scale: ~88 lines across 4 files [M]

- `crates/vox-codegen/tests/null_and_namespace_lowering.rs`:
    - Added `process_run_lowers_to_option_capture_builtin` test to verify `process.run` codegen uses `vox_process_run_opt`.
    - Added `generated_native_manifest_declares_tracing` test to verify `tracing` dependency is added to generated `Cargo.toml`.
    - Renamed `process_run_error_arm_is_err_not_error` test to `json_parse_error_arm_is_err_not_error` and updated its assertion to check for `Err(m)` instead of `Err(Error)`.
